        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "For wind damage roof repair in Utah, schedule a free professional roof inspection immediately through local specialists like Rooval Roofing\n\nto document missing or lifted shingles before moisture or winter weather sets in. Severe canyon winds across the Wasatch Back and Wasatch Front frequently tear away ridge caps, flashing, and tabs, requiring prompt action to protect your home.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "Rooval Roofing"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2,
          3
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Immediate Steps After Wind Damage"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Stay safe: Avoid climbing onto a wet, icy, or visibly compromised roof."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Inspect safely:\nCheck your property from the ground or look in the attic for new water stains, missing debris, or exposed underlayment."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Get emergency tarping: Call a local contractor for temporary tarping if you have exposed decking to stop active leaks."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Compare costs to your deductible:\nMinor shingle blow-offs often cost less to fix out-of-pocket than filing an insurance claim, whereas widespread structural or decking exposure warrants professional insurance documentation."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          4,
          5,
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9
        ]
